      "versionNonce": 1272325597,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790463506135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A square matrix that is equal to its transpose.\nIndeed, it can be produced by multiplying any matrix with its transpose.\n\nConsider:\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A square matrix that is equal to its transpose.\nIndeed, it can be produced by multiplying any matrix with its transpose.\n\nConsider:\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8XnBvLXR3wSccI6BnW3nm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 318.7977832246712,
      "y": 6339.700504657654,
      "width": 847.0388793945312,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1833430253,
      "version": 670,
      "versionNonce": 544043635,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790463506135,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We know if the matrix is Singular, the system will have either no solution or many solution.\nSingularity means one or more dependent vectors in the matrix so all the linear combinations\nmay not contain the vector b on the right hand side or have infinite combinations resulting in b\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We know if the matrix is Singular, the system will have either no solution or many solution.\nSingularity means one or more dependent vectors in the matrix so all the linear combinations\nmay not contain the vector b on the right hand side or have infinite combinations resulting in b\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
